    "findings": [
        "THE FIELD IS EXACTLY SEPARABLE AND THE VERDICT IS NOT. A prestrain is a load, so the solved field under the graded corrugated map is the load-only field plus the 14-site response plus the 42-site response, to 2.10e-15 in the coefficient vector at both overall signs. Peak dishing is a seminorm of that field and does NOT add: the graded peak is 0.2940 of the sum of its two parts' peaks. So no part of the verdict can be assigned to either site set.",
        "THE 42 INTERIOR SITES ARE NOT A CORRECTION, THEY ARE THE SAME ORDER AND THE OPPOSITE SIGN. Their dishing field has 0.6880 of the row-end field's area norm and a cosine of -0.5795 against it. The cancellation is a cross term, not a difference of two peaks, and it is structural: the column next inboard of the row end carries 0.661 of the row end's amplitude on the same number of sites at the opposite sign, which is arithmetic and needs no solve.",
        "THE GRADED FIELD'S OWN ROW-END RESTRICTION IS UNIFORM AT -22.5398 deg AT OVERALL SIGN +, which is the sign C-0107 calls ADVERSE. The lattice's parity rule puts every interface's row-end crossover at the end where (-1)^b u(x) = -u(|x|), so the consistent row-end-only counterpart of the graded 0.0922622 is 0.1190748 and NOT C-0107's 0.1022820: the published comparison pairs the graded field at one overall sign with the row-end-only idealisation at the other. The cancellation is therefore LARGER than published, 0.0268 of the stroke against 0.0100.",
        "THE OVERALL SIGN OF THE CORRUGATION IS UNDETERMINED AND C-0107 READ ONE OF TWO. The glide symmetry says the field alternates with the interface index and does not say which parity folds which way, so both signs are admissible. They read 0.0922622 (flat=true) and 0.0910197 (flat=true).",
        "THE CANCELLATION IS COMPLETE BY THE FIRST INTERIOR COLUMN PAIR. Adding the column pair next inboard of the row ends recovers 106.2 % of the whole row-end-to-graded move; the two innermost pairs together are worth the remainder.",
        "OVER C-0107'S OWN 12-CELL BRACKET AND BOTH SIGNS, 40 of 40 cells keep the graded field flat, against 14 of 40 for the row-end-only idealisation. The cancellation is a property of the field's SHAPE, and the shape is set by lambda/L, which the bracket moves by 2.04x.",
        "THE ROW-END-ONLY IDEALISATION IS THE lambda -> 0 LIMIT OF THE GRADED FIELD, and the Gen-1 tile is nowhere near it: the derived decay length is 18.62 nm against a 19.04 nm half-row, so the field is graded over the whole tile and the 14-site map has nothing behind it. C-0104's three distributions are maps on 14 sites because C-0104 had no field; C-0107 has one.",
        "THE STANDING UNIFORM-LOAD FALSIFIER READS 2.126e-07 on the support-free, prestrain-free lattice. CLAUDE.md's best falsifier is NOT declared against the eigenstrain here: a uniform prestrain is an eigenstrain and the relaxed state is a cylinder, which C-0104 Deliverable 5 measured, so asserting the zero would report a correct solver as broken."
    ],
